61
00:01:40,339 --> 00:01:40,417
À vous :

62
00:01:40,467 --> 00:01:41,378
cinq secondes.

63
00:01:47,121 --> 00:01:47,681
Correction.

64
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:48,698
Apparence :

65
00:01:49,029 --> 00:01:49,421
