68
00:01:51,756 --> 00:01:52,523
un point.

69
00:01:52,805 --> 00:01:53,232
Grimace faible :

70
00:01:53,456 --> 00:01:54,322
un point.

71
00:01:54,557 --> 00:01:55,021
Tonus flasque :

72
00:01:55,334 --> 00:01:55,810
